<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia October producer prices up 1.2 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Slovenia October producer prices up 1.2 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES	  Oct     Sept     Oct95</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	     +1.2     +0.6     +1.2</p>
<p>    Yr/Yr change (pct)		 +6.7     +6.8     +8.6</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
